Simulating methods:
- Add money to treasury financial account
- Test card payment

Enable tunnel:
cloudflared tunnel --url http://localhost:3000


To run app in dev mode we need:
- Run only docker and rabbitmq Docker containers

- Add localhost port to access Docker postgres container
- Replace postgres host to localhost inside URL connection in .env file

- Add localhost port to access Docker rabbitmq container
- Replace rabbitmq host to localhost in .env file

- Don't forget to rebuild Docker images
